WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:04.167
♪♪

00:00:04.167 --> 00:00:05.501
-Let's get to the news.

00:00:05.501 --> 00:00:08.434
Former President Trump
on Saturday said

00:00:08.434 --> 00:00:11.267
that the 2020 election
should be overturned

00:00:11.267 --> 00:00:13.467
and the Constitution
should be terminated.

00:00:13.467 --> 00:00:15.400
Well, I'll say this for him --

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:17.734
he does give a memorable
wedding toast.

00:00:17.734 --> 00:00:20.000
[ Laughter ]

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.367
Tomorrow is
the Georgia Senate runoff,

00:00:22.367 --> 00:00:24.367
and unfortunately,
Herschel Walker's vote

00:00:24.367 --> 00:00:25.868
isn't going to count.

00:00:25.868 --> 00:00:27.801
[ Laughter ]

00:00:29.434 --> 00:00:32.000
President Biden said on Friday
the Democrats must win

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:33.501
the Georgia Senate runoff
to avoid

00:00:33.501 --> 00:00:35.300
a 50/50 split in the chamber.

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:37.834
"But that would mean the end
of my presidency,"

00:00:37.834 --> 00:00:39.501
said Joe Manchin.

00:00:39.501 --> 00:00:41.534
[ Laughter ]

00:00:41.534 --> 00:00:44.033
After she was kicked off
a Spirit Airlines flight,

00:00:44.033 --> 00:00:46.400
former New Jersey governor
Chris Christie's niece,

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:49.767
Shannon Epstein,
reportedly injured six deputies

00:00:49.767 --> 00:00:52.634
while resisting arrest,
including kicking an officer

00:00:52.634 --> 00:00:55.000
in the groin, which can only
mean one thing.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:56.334
She's running.

00:00:56.334 --> 00:00:58.834
[ Laughter ]

00:00:58.834 --> 00:01:01.267
During last night's reception
at the White House

00:01:01.267 --> 00:01:03.534
for Kennedy Center honorees,
President Biden praised

00:01:03.534 --> 00:01:06.701
the band U2 and said their music
has "changed the world."

00:01:06.701 --> 00:01:10.033
Damn, I knew Biden was old, but
I didn't know he was that old.

00:01:10.033 --> 00:01:11.934
[ Laughter ]

00:01:14.734 --> 00:01:17.100
New York City recently posted
a job listing

00:01:17.100 --> 00:01:19.934
for a Director of
Rodent Mitigation,

00:01:19.934 --> 00:01:23.300
which will pay up to
$170,000 a year.

00:01:23.300 --> 00:01:26.667
Wow, 170 grand a year to say,

00:01:26.667 --> 00:01:29.334
"Maybe don't serve dinner
in the gutter?"

00:01:29.334 --> 00:01:31.901
[ Laughter ]

00:01:31.901 --> 00:01:34.067
"Might that mitigate?"

00:01:36.067 --> 00:01:38.701
According to the latest numbers,
crime on New York's subway

00:01:38.701 --> 00:01:40.601
last month decreased by 13%

00:01:40.601 --> 00:01:42.033
because it's hard
to commit a crime

00:01:42.033 --> 00:01:43.701
if you can't move your arms.

00:01:43.701 --> 00:01:46.367
[ Laughter ]

00:01:46.367 --> 00:01:49.667
Rapper Bad Bunny was named
Spotify's most streamed artist

00:01:49.667 --> 00:01:51.334
worldwide in 2022.

00:01:51.334 --> 00:01:52.734
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:52.734 --> 00:01:55.901
No word yet on what he's doing
with his $6.

00:01:55.901 --> 00:01:58.567
[ Laughter ]

00:02:00.467 --> 00:02:02.033
A tortoise named Jonathan

00:02:02.033 --> 00:02:05.767
that lives on the island of
St. Helena recently celebrated

00:02:05.767 --> 00:02:07.701
his 190th birthday

00:02:07.701 --> 00:02:10.667
with his 140-year-old
trophy wife.

00:02:10.667 --> 00:02:12.667
[ Laughter ]

00:02:12.667 --> 00:02:15.701
Everyone's laughing at you,
Jonathan!

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:20.801
And finally, amid the chaotic
pre-sale for Taylor Swift's

00:02:20.801 --> 00:02:23.834
The Eras tour, more than
two dozen fans recently filed

00:02:23.834 --> 00:02:26.434
a lawsuit against Ticketmaster's
parent company, Live Nation,

00:02:26.434 --> 00:02:27.634
for unlawful conduct.

00:02:27.634 --> 00:02:30.033
And while a trial is still
a long ways off,

00:02:30.033 --> 00:02:32.234
pre-sale tickets
are already available.

00:02:32.234 --> 00:02:34.067
[ Laughter ]

00:02:34.067 --> 00:02:37.067
Today is the Georgia
Senate runoff,

00:02:37.067 --> 00:02:39.467
and there's only one candidate
in the race

00:02:39.467 --> 00:02:41.634
who definitely knows that.

00:02:41.634 --> 00:02:44.133
[ Laughter ]

00:02:44.133 --> 00:02:46.801
Georgia Republican Senate
candidate Herschel Walker said

00:02:46.801 --> 00:02:48.300
during a rally over the weekend

00:02:48.300 --> 00:02:50.801
that he doesn't know
what a pronoun is.

00:02:50.801 --> 00:02:53.968
And someone said, "It's what you
call your illegitimate kids."

00:02:53.968 --> 00:02:55.801
And he said, "Oh, them?"

00:02:55.801 --> 00:02:59.300
[ Laughter ]

00:02:59.300 --> 00:03:02.200
That's right, Herschel Walker
said at a rally over the weekend

00:03:02.200 --> 00:03:03.868
that he doesn't know
what a pronoun is.

00:03:03.868 --> 00:03:07.601
Okay, it cannot be good for
Raphael Warnock's self-esteem

00:03:07.601 --> 00:03:08.934
that this is a close race.

00:03:08.934 --> 00:03:11.767
I mean, imagine
seeing your opponent

00:03:11.767 --> 00:03:15.601
basically eating paste
on TV every night

00:03:15.601 --> 00:03:17.667
and knowing he might win.

00:03:17.667 --> 00:03:18.934
[ Laughter ]

00:03:18.934 --> 00:03:20.934
When asked yesterday about
former President Trump

00:03:20.934 --> 00:03:22.934
calling for the termination
of the Constitution,

00:03:22.934 --> 00:03:26.434
Nebraska Senator Ben Sasse
asked if Republicans

00:03:26.434 --> 00:03:29.601
"want to keep giving oxygen to
someone who is trying to sell

00:03:29.601 --> 00:03:32.133
tickets to his own
proprietary circus,

00:03:32.133 --> 00:03:34.734
or do they want to be
a constitutional party."

00:03:34.734 --> 00:03:36.901
Said Republicans,
"We're thinking."

00:03:36.901 --> 00:03:39.901
[ Laughter ]

00:03:39.901 --> 00:03:41.400
President Biden today toured

00:03:41.400 --> 00:03:43.634
a semiconductor
manufacturing company

00:03:43.634 --> 00:03:46.467
in Phoenix, Arizona,
and honestly, I don't even know

00:03:46.467 --> 00:03:48.300
if he did that because
he's the president

00:03:48.300 --> 00:03:50.300
or just because he's 80
and it's Tuesday.

00:03:50.300 --> 00:03:52.634
"Come on, kids!

00:03:52.634 --> 00:03:56.133
Come on.
It'll be interesting.

00:03:56.133 --> 00:04:00.200
My friend Frank works
over at the semiconductor place.

00:04:00.200 --> 00:04:01.868
He's gonna give us
a look at it.

00:04:01.868 --> 00:04:03.501
You have no idea!

00:04:03.501 --> 00:04:06.167
You use semiconductors
every day!"

00:04:06.167 --> 00:04:08.834
[ Laughter ]

00:04:08.834 --> 00:04:10.767
-In a new interview,
Eric Trump pushed back

00:04:10.767 --> 00:04:12.901
against reports that
the Trump family doesn't like

00:04:12.901 --> 00:04:15.234
Don Jr.'s fiancée,
Kimberly Guilfoyle.

00:04:15.234 --> 00:04:16.567
Okay, but keep in mind,

00:04:16.567 --> 00:04:18.934
he also thinks they like him.

00:04:18.934 --> 00:04:21.267
[ Laughter ]

00:04:21.267 --> 00:04:24.601
Indonesia's parliament today
outlawed premarital sex.

00:04:24.601 --> 00:04:25.601
What?

00:04:25.601 --> 00:04:27.601
But that's the good kind.

00:04:27.601 --> 00:04:30.601
[ Laughter ]

00:04:33.434 --> 00:04:34.434
Eh...

00:04:36.367 --> 00:04:38.868
-A middle school nurse
in Florida was accused last week

00:04:38.868 --> 00:04:41.033
of taking more than 100
Adderall pills

00:04:41.033 --> 00:04:44.033
from at least five children
and replacing them with aspirin.

00:04:44.033 --> 00:04:46.033
And she had the right
to remain silent,

00:04:46.033 --> 00:04:48.701
but that's not an option
after 100 Adderall.

00:04:48.701 --> 00:04:50.834
"Okay, I wasn't supposed
to do that, but also,

00:04:50.834 --> 00:04:52.667
maybe it's okay because that
means someone down the road

00:04:52.667 --> 00:04:54.167
will know not to do it,
so that's actually

00:04:54.167 --> 00:04:55.501
for the greater good
when you think about it.

00:04:55.501 --> 00:04:56.868
And you know what else?
I should totally write

00:04:56.868 --> 00:04:58.701
a novel about this!"

00:04:58.701 --> 00:05:00.434
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:00.434 --> 00:05:02.000
Thank you. [ Chuckles ]

00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:04.267
[ Applause continues ]

00:05:04.267 --> 00:05:06.434
And that was Adderall Theater.

00:05:06.434 --> 00:05:07.601
[ Laughter ]

00:05:07.601 --> 00:05:09.000
It was recently announced that

00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:11.434
the Ripley's Believe It or Not!
Museum in Atlantic City

00:05:11.434 --> 00:05:13.267
will close at the end
of the year,

00:05:13.267 --> 00:05:15.334
because when you walk
around Atlantic City,

00:05:15.334 --> 00:05:17.801
anything becomes believable.

00:05:17.801 --> 00:05:19.167
[ Laughter ]

00:05:19.167 --> 00:05:21.534
And finally, a charity
in Australia recently attempted

00:05:21.534 --> 00:05:22.868
to break a Guinness World Record

00:05:22.868 --> 00:05:25.701
by lining up nearly 1,100
wrapped presents.

00:05:25.701 --> 00:05:27.767
It would beat the previous
record holder --

00:05:27.767 --> 00:05:30.267
someone whose parents
just got divorced.

00:05:30.267 --> 00:05:33.267
[ Laughter and groans ]

00:05:35.767 --> 00:05:38.434
-And that's a Merry Christmas
monologue joke

00:05:38.434 --> 00:05:41.367
from the monster Mike Scollins.

00:05:43.100 --> 00:05:45.501
Democratic Senator
Raphael Warnock

00:05:45.501 --> 00:05:47.000
is projected to defeat

00:05:47.000 --> 00:05:48.968
Republican candidate
Herschel Walker

00:05:48.968 --> 00:05:50.601
in the Georgia Senate
runoff race.

00:05:50.601 --> 00:05:52.634
And if you think
you're relieved,

00:05:52.634 --> 00:05:56.167
imagine how relieved
Herschel Walker is.

00:05:56.167 --> 00:06:00.234
He just narrowly avoided
a six-year-long pop quiz

00:06:00.234 --> 00:06:02.200
he did not study for.

00:06:02.200 --> 00:06:03.300
[ Laughter ]

00:06:03.300 --> 00:06:05.167
That's right,
CNN last night projected

00:06:05.167 --> 00:06:06.400
that Georgia Senator
Raphael Warnock

00:06:06.400 --> 00:06:07.934
will win reelection.

00:06:07.934 --> 00:06:11.667
And then Herschel Walker picked
up an iron to call and concede.

00:06:11.667 --> 00:06:13.501
[ Laughter ]

00:06:17.367 --> 00:06:19.767
The Trump Organization
was found guilty yesterday

00:06:19.767 --> 00:06:21.901
in a New York court
for criminal tax fraud.

00:06:21.901 --> 00:06:24.634
Trump will be sentenced
to four years as president.

00:06:24.634 --> 00:06:26.467
[ Laughter ]

00:06:26.467 --> 00:06:28.501
That's right,
a Manhattan jury yesterday

00:06:28.501 --> 00:06:31.200
found former President Trump's
company guilty

00:06:31.200 --> 00:06:34.901
of orchestrating a 15-year
criminal tax fraud scheme.

00:06:34.901 --> 00:06:37.367
Though it succeeded -- Though --

00:06:37.367 --> 00:06:39.501
[ Laughter ]

00:06:39.501 --> 00:06:42.434
Was always something wrong
with the syntax of the joke.

00:06:42.434 --> 00:06:45.601
For me.
It was written fine.

00:06:45.601 --> 00:06:47.868
Eh, let's do it one more time.

00:06:47.868 --> 00:06:49.200
Sorry, Baze.

00:06:49.200 --> 00:06:50.367
You know what
the worst thing is?

00:06:50.367 --> 00:06:53.167
Our head writer
is allowed to fire me.

00:06:53.167 --> 00:06:55.000
[ Laughter ]

00:06:56.901 --> 00:06:58.601
That's right,
a Manhattan jury yesterday

00:06:58.601 --> 00:07:00.601
found former President Trump's
company guilty

00:07:00.601 --> 00:07:03.701
of orchestrating a 15-year
criminal tax fraud scheme.

00:07:03.701 --> 00:07:05.133
Though it succeeded for --

00:07:05.133 --> 00:07:06.133
[Bleep]

00:07:06.133 --> 00:07:08.133
[ Laughter ]

00:07:08.133 --> 00:07:10.100
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:07:12.634 --> 00:07:15.133
No. How dare you?!

00:07:15.133 --> 00:07:17.467
My name's on the door!

00:07:17.467 --> 00:07:19.400
[ Laughter ]

00:07:22.834 --> 00:07:24.968
I'm going to try.

00:07:24.968 --> 00:07:26.033
Alright.

00:07:26.033 --> 00:07:27.501
"Though it succeeded
for so long..."

00:07:27.501 --> 00:07:28.734
Okay.

00:07:28.734 --> 00:07:31.400
[ Clears throat ]

00:07:31.400 --> 00:07:32.968
"Though it..."

00:07:32.968 --> 00:07:36.467
"Though it succeeded for..."
Okay.

00:07:36.467 --> 00:07:39.701
"Though it succeeded..."
Okay.

00:07:39.701 --> 00:07:41.200
This better work.

00:07:41.200 --> 00:07:43.634
[ Laughter ]

00:07:43.634 --> 00:07:45.467
That's right,
a Manhattan jury yesterday

00:07:45.467 --> 00:07:47.501
found former President Trump's
company guilty

00:07:47.501 --> 00:07:50.300
of orchestrating a 15-year
criminal tax fraud scheme.

00:07:50.300 --> 00:07:52.033
Though it succeeded for so long,

00:07:52.033 --> 00:07:54.868
there's no way Trump
had anything to do with it.

00:07:54.868 --> 00:07:57.067
[ Laughter ]

00:07:57.067 --> 00:07:59.133
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:08:10.801 --> 00:08:13.000
We got to have a rehearsal
from now on.

00:08:13.000 --> 00:08:15.000
[ Laughter ]

00:08:17.501 --> 00:08:20.033
President Biden
visited Arizona yesterday

00:08:20.033 --> 00:08:21.601
for the first time
in his presidency.

00:08:21.601 --> 00:08:25.467
Said Biden, "Wow, the last time
I was here, this was all flat."

00:08:25.467 --> 00:08:27.133
[ Laughter ]

00:08:27.133 --> 00:08:28.634
Alright, Baze, you know what?

00:08:28.634 --> 00:08:30.334
I'm going to turn the tables.

00:08:30.334 --> 00:08:31.868
That joke makes
no [bleep] sense.

00:08:31.868 --> 00:08:33.267
Can you go back?

00:08:33.267 --> 00:08:34.667
[ Laughter ]

00:08:34.667 --> 00:08:37.601
Yeah, they all laughed
'cause he's an old man, ha-ha.

00:08:37.601 --> 00:08:38.701
But...

00:08:38.701 --> 00:08:41.000
President Biden
visited Arizona yesterday

00:08:41.000 --> 00:08:42.534
for the first time
in his presidency.

00:08:42.534 --> 00:08:44.934
So, like, for the first time
in two years.

00:08:44.934 --> 00:08:47.901
That meant three years ago,
he was probably there.

00:08:47.901 --> 00:08:49.734
Why was it flat then?

00:08:49.734 --> 00:08:51.901
[ Laughter ]

00:08:51.901 --> 00:08:55.300
Maybe if it was like "for the
first time since he was a kid,"

00:08:55.300 --> 00:08:57.300
then the joke works.

00:08:57.300 --> 00:08:59.467
'Cause he's so old.

00:08:59.467 --> 00:09:00.901
You know what I'm saying?

00:09:00.901 --> 00:09:02.701
I just want to make something
clear to all of you.

00:09:02.701 --> 00:09:04.467
We're all doing a bad job.

00:09:04.467 --> 00:09:05.467
[ Laughter ]

00:09:05.467 --> 00:09:06.534
Okay?

00:09:06.534 --> 00:09:08.534
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:09:13.400 --> 00:09:17.067
And I will make this same speech
at the Christmas party!

00:09:17.067 --> 00:09:19.400
[ Laughter ]

00:09:19.400 --> 00:09:21.634
During last week's
White House state dinner,

00:09:21.634 --> 00:09:23.200
French President Emmanuel Macron

00:09:23.200 --> 00:09:26.000
reportedly toasted to President
Biden's reelection campaign.

00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:28.300
Either that or Biden said
he was running again

00:09:28.300 --> 00:09:29.968
and Macron
just started drinking.

00:09:29.968 --> 00:09:31.634
[ Laughter ]

00:09:31.634 --> 00:09:33.834
President Biden yesterday
encouraged Americans

00:09:33.834 --> 00:09:36.634
to get updated
coronavirus vaccine shots

00:09:36.634 --> 00:09:37.968
ahead of the holidays,

00:09:37.968 --> 00:09:42.067
if for no other reason
than Santa's 2,000 years old.

00:09:42.067 --> 00:09:44.868
[ Light laughter ]

00:09:44.868 --> 00:09:46.501
Is that Scol--
Who wrote that?

00:09:46.501 --> 00:09:48.767
Scollins?
Scollins wrote that joke.

00:09:48.767 --> 00:09:51.334
He's one of our writers
who doesn't like people.

00:09:51.334 --> 00:09:55.000
And what he wanted in the key

00:09:55.000 --> 00:09:57.400
was Santa on a ventilator.

00:09:57.400 --> 00:10:00.400
[ Laughter, groans ]

00:10:00.400 --> 00:10:02.067
That's just hearing it.

00:10:02.067 --> 00:10:05.167
That's the reaction you make
when you hear it.

00:10:05.167 --> 00:10:07.167
He wanted to show it to you.

00:10:07.167 --> 00:10:09.267
[ Laughter ]

00:10:09.267 --> 00:10:12.701
New York's annual SantaCon
bar crawl is this weekend,

00:10:12.701 --> 00:10:15.400
and more than 60 bars
are expected to participate,

00:10:15.400 --> 00:10:17.767
as well as several local jails.

00:10:17.767 --> 00:10:19.601
[ Laughter ]

00:10:19.601 --> 00:10:21.334
BuzzFeed announced plans
yesterday

00:10:21.334 --> 00:10:23.467
to lay off roughly 180 staffers.

00:10:23.467 --> 00:10:25.934
Even worse --
the way they announced it.

00:10:25.934 --> 00:10:27.767
[ Laughter ]

00:10:32.834 --> 00:10:36.334
Oy, somebody put Santa on
a ventilator with that joke.

00:10:36.334 --> 00:10:37.467
[ Laughter ]

00:10:37.467 --> 00:10:39.133
Ben &amp; Jerry's
announced yesterday

00:10:39.133 --> 00:10:40.934
they will release a new flavor

00:10:40.934 --> 00:10:42.934
curated by director
Ava DuVernay.

00:10:42.934 --> 00:10:45.234
Meanwhile, the
James Cameron-inspired flavor

00:10:45.234 --> 00:10:48.567
is currently 10 years behind
and $200 million over budget.

00:10:48.567 --> 00:10:50.434
[ Laughter ]

00:10:50.434 --> 00:10:52.300
Regulators in Minnesota
this week

00:10:52.300 --> 00:10:54.234
accused
a marijuana edibles company

00:10:54.234 --> 00:10:57.067
of selling gummy bears that were
50 times more powerful

00:10:57.067 --> 00:10:59.367
than what is legally
allowed to be sold.

00:10:59.367 --> 00:11:00.968
This actually happened
last year,

00:11:00.968 --> 00:11:03.467
but all the witnesses
just woke up.

00:11:03.467 --> 00:11:06.300
[ Laughter ]

00:11:06.300 --> 00:11:08.801
And finally,
according to a new survey,

00:11:08.801 --> 00:11:12.834
just 2% of Americans said
that they never felt happy

00:11:12.834 --> 00:11:15.267
when someone they like
succeeds at something.

00:11:15.267 --> 00:11:16.767
Or as they put it on Instagram,

00:11:16.767 --> 00:11:19.100
"Oh, my God,
I love that for you."

00:11:19.100 --> 00:11:21.100
[ Laughter ]

00:11:21.100 --> 00:11:24.100
WNBA star Brittney Griner was
released today

00:11:24.100 --> 00:11:26.734
from a Russian prison
in exchange for

00:11:26.734 --> 00:11:28.567
an international arms dealer.

00:11:28.567 --> 00:11:30.801
It's the first time
the U.S. has traded

00:11:30.801 --> 00:11:32.634
an alleged weed smoker

00:11:32.634 --> 00:11:34.467
for an international criminal

00:11:34.467 --> 00:11:36.334
since 2016.

00:11:36.334 --> 00:11:38.334
[ Laughter ]

00:11:38.334 --> 00:11:40.567
President Biden tweeted
this morning

00:11:40.567 --> 00:11:42.934
about the release of WNBA star
Brittney Griner

00:11:42.934 --> 00:11:45.767
from a Russian prison
and said, "She is safe,

00:11:45.767 --> 00:11:48.467
she is on a plane,
she is on her way home,

00:11:48.467 --> 00:11:50.033
and I'd say she's happy,

00:11:50.033 --> 00:11:53.734
but she's still a 6'9" person
on a plane."

00:11:53.734 --> 00:11:55.734
[ Laughter ]

00:11:55.734 --> 00:11:58.267
Former President Trump's legal
team reportedly found at least

00:11:58.267 --> 00:12:01.334
two items marked classified
while searching through

00:12:01.334 --> 00:12:03.100
one of his
Florida storage units,

00:12:03.100 --> 00:12:05.501
and that's not all they found.

00:12:05.501 --> 00:12:07.801
[ Laughter ]

00:12:09.934 --> 00:12:11.767
[As Giuliani] I'm having trouble
with my rent.

00:12:13.400 --> 00:12:14.534
[Normal voice] That's right.

00:12:14.534 --> 00:12:16.000
Trump's legal team
reportedly found at least

00:12:16.000 --> 00:12:17.434
two items marked classified

00:12:17.434 --> 00:12:19.400
in one of his storage units
in West Palm Beach.

00:12:19.400 --> 00:12:21.234
You needed a storage unit?

00:12:21.234 --> 00:12:23.234
How many documents
did you steal?

00:12:23.234 --> 00:12:25.734
You live in a hotel.

00:12:25.734 --> 00:12:27.300
[ Laughter ]

00:12:27.300 --> 00:12:29.067
For the first time
in four decades,

00:12:29.067 --> 00:12:31.634
journalists and staffers at
The New York Times last night

00:12:31.634 --> 00:12:33.767
began a 24-hour strike
to protest

00:12:33.767 --> 00:12:35.300
for better salaries
and benefits.

00:12:35.300 --> 00:12:38.467
So for today only,
there were two reasons

00:12:38.467 --> 00:12:41.567
why posting your Wordle score
makes you a jerk.

00:12:41.567 --> 00:12:43.567
[ Laughter ]

00:12:45.567 --> 00:12:47.100
According to a new study,

00:12:47.100 --> 00:12:48.501
it takes
the average American worker

00:12:48.501 --> 00:12:49.834
one year and seven months

00:12:49.834 --> 00:12:52.133
to feel like they're thriving
in a new job.

00:12:52.133 --> 00:12:53.467
Here's the study.

00:12:54.400 --> 00:12:56.367
[ Laughter ]

00:12:58.133 --> 00:12:59.667
Oprah recently released

00:12:59.667 --> 00:13:01.901
the annual list
of her favorite things.

00:13:01.901 --> 00:13:03.367
Coming in at number one --

00:13:03.367 --> 00:13:05.133
creating a monster!

00:13:05.133 --> 00:13:07.133
[ Laughter, groans ]

00:13:07.133 --> 00:13:09.767
[ Laughter ]

00:13:09.767 --> 00:13:11.968
Firefighters recently
rescued a puppy

00:13:11.968 --> 00:13:14.300
that swam about a mile
across the Hudson River

00:13:14.300 --> 00:13:15.801
from Manhattan to New Jersey.

00:13:15.801 --> 00:13:16.968
They tried to return it,

00:13:16.968 --> 00:13:18.934
but it had already found
an affordable home

00:13:18.934 --> 00:13:21.067
with a backyard
and started a family.

00:13:21.067 --> 00:13:23.567
[ Laughter ]

00:13:23.567 --> 00:13:26.033
The appliance company Dyson
is set to launch

00:13:26.033 --> 00:13:28.267
a set of noise-canceling
headphones

00:13:28.267 --> 00:13:30.334
with a detachable air purifier.

00:13:30.334 --> 00:13:32.634
It's part of Dyson's
long-time mission

00:13:32.634 --> 00:13:33.968
of trying to figure out

00:13:33.968 --> 00:13:36.100
what the hell
their company sells.

00:13:36.100 --> 00:13:37.868
[ Laughter ]

00:13:39.100 --> 00:13:40.767
[ Laughter ]

00:13:40.767 --> 00:13:42.534
"Headph-- Headphones?"

00:13:43.734 --> 00:13:45.267
And finally, Google released

00:13:45.267 --> 00:13:48.234
its annual year-end
search list yesterday,

00:13:48.234 --> 00:13:51.601
and the most searched TV show
in the U.S. was "Euphoria,"

00:13:51.601 --> 00:13:53.400
as in,
"Where can I get the drugs

00:13:53.400 --> 00:13:56.067
they were doing
in last night's 'Euphoria'?"

00:13:56.067 --> 00:13:58.067
And that was a monologue,
everybody!

00:13:58.067 --> 00:14:03.133
♪♪

